sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client (Angular)
    participant GW as API Gateway (:8080)
    participant VS as Vehicle Service (:8082)
    participant RS as Reservation Service (:8083)
    participant PS as Payment Service (:8084)
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ Broker

    Note over Client, GW: Étape 1 : Recherche & Disponibilité
    Client->>GW: GET /api/vehicles/search?agency=1&cat=SUV
    GW->>VS: GET /api/vehicles/search
    VS-->>GW: 200 OK [Liste véhicules]
    GW-->>Client: 200 OK (Catalogue affiché)

    Note over Client, GW: Étape 2 : Demande de Réservation
    Client->>GW: POST /api/reservations (JWT, dates, vehicleId=5)
    GW->>RS: POST /api/reservations

    Note over RS, VS: Étape 3 : Vérification Synchrone (Feign)
    RS->>VS: GET /api/vehicles/5 (Vérifier tarif & état)
    VS-->>RS: 200 OK {pricePerDay: 45, status: AVAILABLE}
    Note over RS: Calcul montant (5j * 45€ = 225€) + Sauvegarde (PENDING)

    Note over RS, PS: Étape 4 : Déclenchement Paiement (Feign)
    RS->>PS: POST /api/payments/process (225€, CREDIT_CARD)
    Note over PS: Simulation succès -> Statut PAID + Facture
    PS-->>RS: 201 Created {status: PAID, txId: TX-77892}

    Note over RS, MQ: Étape 5 : Confirmation & Événement Asynchrone
    Note over RS: Mise à jour statut -> CONFIRMED
    RS-)MQ: Événement "reservation.confirmed" {resId: 101, vehicleId: 5}
    MQ-)VS: Consomme événement -> màj statut véhicule (RENTED)

    RS-->>GW: 201 Created (Réservation confirmée)
    GW-->>Client: 201 Created (Confirmation & Facture)
